                <pb facs="0396" n="316" sameAs="frus:frus1902/pg316"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Certificate</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States of America</hi>,<lb/><hi
                                rendition="#italic">Bogotá</hi></placeName>, <date
                            ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-document-content-and-sibling-dates"
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1902-06-08">—— ——</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>This witnessth, that —— ——, who desires to travel from Bogotá to ——, is a citizen
                    of the United States of America. From all the information I have of him he is
                    neutral in all that relates to the domestic politics of the Republic of
                    Colombia, and he desires that there be issued to him the passport necessary for
                    his journey.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
